OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785259144
OL,3,CFuneral bosses had 'moral obligation
OL,4,Cto act' over bodies 'horror'
OL,6,FTwo funeral directors who discovered
OL,7,Fdecomposing bodies at a business run
OL,8,Fby a fraudulent fellow funerals boss
OL,9,Fhave told ITV News they were "shocked
OL,10,Fand disgusted" by what they found.
OL,12,FGary Pickering and Steve Emmerson, who
OL,13,Frun Evergreen Funeral Directors in
OL,14,FHull, gained access to Legacy
OL,15,FIndependent Funeral Directors after
OL,16,Fbeing told its owner Robert Bush had
OL,17,Fbeen keeping bodies there for months.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785259144
OL,3,CFuneral bosses had 'moral obligation
OL,4,Cto act' over bodies 'horror'
OL,6,FA court heard they were so "shaken" by
OL,7,Fwhat they found they immediately
OL,8,Fflagged down a passing police car to
OL,9,Freport it.
OL,11,FWhen officers attended, they found
OL,12,Fbodies stored on the racks of a cold
OL,13,Fstorage area at varying stages of
OL,14,Fdecomposition.
OL,16,FIn a statement Mr Pickering and Mr
OL,17,FEmmerson told ITV News: "We were
OL,18,Fshocked and disgusted by what we had
OL,19,Fbeen told and knew we had a moral and
OL,20,Fprofessional obligation to act without
OL,21,Fdelay."
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785259144
OL,3,CFuneral bosses had 'moral obligation
OL,4,Cto act' over bodies 'horror'
OL,6,FBush, 48, is being sentenced at Hull
OL,7,FCrown Court for 67 offences including
OL,8,Fpreventing lawful and decent burials.
OL,10,FThe court heard how his offences came
OL,11,Fto light by chance, when he was on
OL,12,Fholiday in Arizona and contacted
OL,13,FEvergreen to ask for assistance in
OL,14,Frecovering a body while he was away.
OL,16,FPatrick Moore ` a casual worker for
OL,17,FLegacy ` helped Mr Mr Pickering and Mr
OL,18,FEmmerson collect the body from a care
OL,19,Fhome, but said Bush had told him "not
OL,20,Fto bring anyone back to Legacy or help
OL,21,Fput a body into the fridge area".
OL,26,@{D@bOU}D@`O]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
