FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785259144
OL,3,CFuneral bosses had 'moral obligation
OL,4,Cto act' over bodies 'horror'
OL,6,FThe court heard Mr Moore then told the
OL,7,Fmen: "You two don't know the half of
OL,8,Fit - bodies have been there for years."
OL,10,FAfter becoming suspicious, Mr Emmerson
OL,11,Flater asked Mr Moore how many bodies
OL,12,Fwere there.
OL,14,FMr Moore counted up to 29 bodies,
OL,15,Fdescribing it as being something from
OL,16,Fa "horror scene".
OL,26,@oD@FOUpD@gO]xD@COUxD@PO]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G4/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785259144
OL,3,CFuneral bosses had 'moral obligation
OL,4,Cto act' over bodies 'horror'
OL,6,FThe court heard Mr Emmerson and Mr
OL,7,FPickering persuaded Mr Moore to let
OL,8,Fthem into Legacy's site on Hessle
OL,9,FRoad, despite him initially being
OL,10,Fafraid of "repercussions".
OL,12,FThe two men were "shocked" at what
OL,13,Fthey saw at Legacy and flagged down a
OL,14,Fpassing police car.
OL,16,FIn their statement Mr Pickering and Mr
OL,17,FEmmerson said: "Our priority was, and
OL,18,Falways will be, the dignity and
OL,19,Frespectful care of the deceased,
OL,20,Ftogether with protecting bereaved
OL,21,Ffamilies."
OL,26,@rD@KOUrD@YO]tD@ROUtD@ZO]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G5/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
