FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785259144
OL,3,CFuneral bosses had 'moral obligation
OL,4,Cto act' over bodies 'horror'
OL,6,FThey praised Humberside Police and the
OL,7,Fcoroner's service for their
OL,8,F"professionalism, compassion and
OL,9,Funwavering commitment".
OL,11,FThey also called for tighter industry
OL,12,Fcontrols, saying: "Evergreen Funeral
OL,13,FServices believes there is no place in
OL,14,Four profession for anything less than
OL,15,Fthe very highest standards of care.
OL,17,F"Now is a time we should embrace more
OL,18,Fregulation within the funeral industry
OL,19,Fto ensure funeral directors act within
OL,20,Fthe same standards as ourselves."
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G6/6
